Speech Recognition
  Key Steps for ML project:
    1. Collect Data
        "Hello", "Hey Siri", "Alexa"
    2. Train Model
        Audio 1: "Hello"
        Audio 2: "Hey Siri"
        Audio 3: "Alexa"
          The AI model will fail the first few times tries to connect input audio A to               the correct inpur B. 
          This means that the AI engineers need to go through many interations until the             AI model is good enough
    3. Deploy Model
        Try this product on testing groups. 
        Ex. if the AI model was only trained on American-accented spearkers, then it                   would have a harder time picking up on what Brisith, Austrailian, or Indian               accented people are saying. 
      Get back the data from the testing groups and maintain/update the model based on           the results. 

Self-driving car
  1. Collect Data
      Input A: Images of of cars driving on the road from the First Person POV
      Then tell it what input B is: Draw rectangles around the cars you want the model to         point out. 
  2. Train Model
      Iterating many times so the AI model recognizes cars in a picture on its own. 
      It will fail many times and pick out a tree or road sign and think it is a car, but       eventually, it will start identifying where the cars are. 
  3. Deploy the model
      Put the software in test cars and collect this trial data. 
      Maintain and update AI model based on data. 
        Ex. Golf carts aren't being detected
